# CommonsLang_Python

## Overview

Redistributes a Python toolchain as a dk package: the CPython runtime and the uv
package/project manager, so dk0 can install and run Python and ingest PyPI
distributions.

`CommonsLang_Python` bundles the relocatable CPython runtime
([astral-sh/python-build-standalone](https://github.com/astral-sh/python-build-standalone),
3.13.14) and [uv](https://github.com/astral-sh/uv) (0.12.1) for Windows, Linux,
and macOS slots, analogous to the existing `CommonsLang_OCaml` /
`CommonsLang_Rust` / `CommonsLang_DotNet` toolchains. Binaries are fetched from
each project's official GitHub releases and verified by SHA-256. Requested in
[diskuv/dk#105](https://github.com/diskuv/dk/issues/105); it unblocks the dk-ai
`convert-pypi-to-dk-package` skill and the Python/PyPI mini-plans the Prompt
Studio produces.

